    LLM: 'Left of dealer leads; no suit obligation. Highest card wins trick (ties = trick spoiled, same player leads again). Nine tricks. First to 3 tricks turns a card face up; first to 3 turns two up (to remember order for ties). Partners may signal by agreed gestures.',
    Player: 'Left of dealer leads; no suit obligation. Highest card wins trick (ties = trick spoiled, same player leads again). Nine tricks. First to 3 tricks turns a card face up; first to 3 turns two up (to remember order for ties). Partners may signal by agreed gestures.',
